{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"## 1. POST /cart/items\n`CartController.addItem()`\n\n**Header** : `X-Session-Id: session_xxx`\n**Body** : `{ variantId, quantity }`\n\n→ `CartService.addItem()`\n- Cherche ou crée un `Cart` par sessionId\n- Vérifie le stock disponible\n- Crée ou met à jour `CartItem`\n- Retourne le `Cart` mis à jour\n\n**Entité** : `Cart`, `CartItem`","x":-310,"y":-320,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"## 2. POST /checkout/create-session\n`CheckoutController.createSession()`\n\n**Body** : `{ items, couponCode? }`\n\n→ `CheckoutService.createCheckoutSession()`\n1. Fetch variants + produits + images\n2. Vérif stock `StockService.checkStockAvailability()`\n3. Calcul subtotal, réduction coupon\n4. Appel Stripe API ↓","x":580,"y":-320,"width":400,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"warning","type":"text","text":"## ⚠️ Points de vigilance\n\n1. **Stripe CLI** requis en dev pour les webhooks\n   `stripe listen --forward-to localhost:3001/checkout/webhook`\n\n2. **Idempotence** : ne pas créer 2 commandes pour 1 webhook\n\n3. **Expiration 7j** : job cron à prévoir pour annuler les PENDING expirés\n\n4. **Metadata Stripe** : limité à 500 chars par clé\n\n5. ~~**Bug cart** : `useLocalStorage` ne persiste pas le sessionId initial~~ ✅ **CORRIGÉ 29/03/2026** — `useLocalStorage.ts` écrit la valeur initiale dans localStorage","x":440,"y":-720,"width":850,"height":240,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# ⚙️ Flow Paiement — Côté Serveur (NestJS + Stripe)\n\nArchitecture : Stripe Checkout Session + Capture Manuelle\nValidé le 29/03/2026","x":-310,"y":-720,"width":500,"height":120,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"entities","type":"text","text":"## Entités PostgreSQL\n\n| Entité | Rôle |\n|---|---|\n| `Cart` | Panier par sessionId |\n| `CartItem` | Ligne du panier |\n| `Order` | Commande (PENDING/PAID/CANCELLED) |\n| `OrderItem` | Ligne de commande |\n| `Variant` | Produit+taille+couleur+stock |\n| `Coupon` | Code promo |\n\n**PaymentIntent Stripe statuts :**\n`requires_capture` → capturé = `succeeded`\n`requires_capture` → annulé = `canceled`","x":-360,"y":140,"width":500,"height":440,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"files","type":"text","text":"## Fichiers Clés\n\n**Backend**\n- `checkout.controller.ts`\n- `checkout.service.ts`\n- `orders.service.ts`\n- `stock.service.ts`\n- `order.entity.ts`\n\n**Frontend**\n- `CartSummary.tsx` → bouton checkout\n- `services/checkout.ts` → API call\n- `hooks/useCart.ts` → sessionId\n- `OrderConfirmation.tsx`","x":-360,"y":680,"width":360,"height":280},
		{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"## 4. Stripe Webhook\n`POST /checkout/webhook`\n`CheckoutController.handleWebhook()`\n\n- Vérification signature HMAC-SHA256\n  (`stripe.webhooks.constructEvent`)\n- Event : `checkout.session.completed`\n- En dev : parse sans vérif si pas de secret\n\n→ `CheckoutService.handleWebhook()`\n→ `handleCheckoutCompleted(session)`","x":940,"y":680,"width":420,"height":240,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"## 5. handleCheckoutCompleted()\n\nExtraction depuis la session Stripe :\n- `metadata.userId` → `'anonymous'` ou userId\n- `metadata.items` → JSON parse\n- `payment_intent` → paymentIntentId\n- `customer_details.email`, `name`, `phone`\n- `shipping_details.address` → shippingAddress\n- `customer_details.address` → billingAddress\n- `amount_total / 100` → total €\n- `metadata.couponId`, `discountAmount`\n\n→ `OrdersService.createFromStripeCheckout()`","x":850,"y":1200,"width":440,"height":390,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"## 6. Création Commande PENDING\n`OrdersService.createFromStripeCheckout()`\n\n- Crée `Order` avec status **`PENDING`** (pas PAID)\n- Stocke `paymentIntentId` (pour capture ultérieure)\n- Stocke adresses livraison + facturation\n- Stocke email client (guest support)\n- **NE décrémente PAS le stock** (attente admin)\n- Crée `OrderItem` par article\n- Envoie email de confirmation client\n\n**Entité** : `Order`, `OrderItem`, `Address`","x":2160,"y":1210,"width":420,"height":380,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"s7b","type":"text","text":"## 7b. Admin Annule ❌\n`POST /admin/orders/:id/cancel`\n\n1. `stripe.paymentIntents.cancel(paymentIntentId)`\n2. PaymentIntent → `canceled`\n3. `Order.status = CANCELLED`\n4. Stock NON touché\n5. Envoie email annulation client (pas de débit)\n\n**Ou** expiration auto après 7 jours","x":2910,"y":1680,"width":380,"height":340,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"s7a","type":"text","text":"## 7a. Admin Valide ✅\n`POST /admin/orders/:id/capture`\n\n1. `stripe.paymentIntents.capture(paymentIntentId)`\n2. PaymentIntent → `succeeded`\n3. `Order.status = PAID`\n4. Décrémente le stock des variants\n5. Envoie email confirmation paiement\n\n**Délai max : 7 jours** (expiration PaymentIntent)","x":2910,"y":1050,"width":380,"height":320,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"## 3. Stripe API — Checkout Session\n`stripe.checkout.sessions.create()`\n\n```\npayment_method_types: ['card']\nmode: 'payment'\nline_items: [...]\npayment_intent_data: {\n  capture_method: 'manual' ⭐\n}\nshipping_address_collection: { ... }\nphone_number_collection: { enabled: true }\nsuccess_url: /order-confirmation?session_id={ID}\ncancel_url: /cart\nmetadata: { userId, items, subtotal, couponCode }\n```\n\n→ Retourne `{ url: \"https://checkout.stripe.com/...\" }`","x":1070,"y":140,"width":460,"height":280,"color":"4"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e1-2","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","label":"Client clique Checkout"},
		{"id":"e2-3","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"left","label":"Appel Stripe API"},
		{"id":"e3-4","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","label":"Client paie → Stripe webhook"},
		{"id":"e4-5","fromNode":"s4","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","label":"checkout.session.completed"},
		{"id":"e5-6","fromNode":"s5","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s6","toSide":"left","label":"createFromStripeCheckout"},
		{"id":"e6-7a","fromNode":"s6","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s7a","toSide":"left","label":"Admin valide"},
		{"id":"e6-7b","fromNode":"s6","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s7b","toSide":"left","label":"Admin annule"},
